ock Music in 500 Songs","episode":"Episode 114: \"My Boy Lollipop\" by Millie","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kf-DtqoOsRI"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Musical Style","body":"Lloyd Price was known for producing music in a similar style to Fats Domino, performing sessions with the same musicians as Domino. \"All of these people were veterans of sessions either for Domino or for artists who had worked in Domino's style, like Lloyd Price or Smiley Lewis.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"A History of Rock Music in 500 Songs","episode":"Episode 34: \"Tutti Frutti\" by Little Richard","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7mk9SW46Li4"}]},{"kind":"podcast","title":"Recommendation to Specialty Records","body":"Lloyd Price suggested to Little Richard that he send a demo tape to Specialty Records, which was Price's own label. This recommendation ultimately led to Richard's breakthrough with the label. \"Richard had met Lloyd Price, and Price had suggested that Richard send a demo tape in to specialty records, Price's label.\"","year":null,"extra":null,"srcs":[{"source":"A History of Rock Music in 500 Songs","episode":"Episode 34: \"Tutti Frutti\" by Little Richard","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7mk9SW46Li4"}]}],"awards":[],"concerts":[],"xref":[],"charts":[{"id":51573837728146,"type":"song","name":"Stagger Lee","work_year":1959,"list_id":157497903047680,"list":"Billboard Hot 100 nº1 · 1960s","src":"singles","rank":10,"year":1959,"note":"4 semanas","yt":"FCPutYaGFlE","scaruffi":null},{"id":267907449397249,"type":"song","name":"Personality","work_year":1959,"list_id":245563783135764,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1959","src":"singles","rank":3,"year":1959,"note":"","yt":"MvPU-cvaKCM","scaruffi":null},{"id":51573837728146,"type":"song","name":"Stagger Lee","work_year":1959,"list_id":245563783135764,"list":"Billboard Year-End 1959","src":"singles","rank":13,"year":1959,"note":"","yt":"FCPutYaGFlE","scaruffi":null},{"id":171266113444304,"type":"song","